<title>USA: Marshall, Mo., won by AG Edwards.</title>
<headline>Marshall, Mo., won by AG Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it won $5.940 million of Marshall, Mo., sanitary sewer system refunding revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.037 percent.</p>
</text>
